    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to help but it just feels so irrational to keep fighting it. like, if i were looking at this objectively, i'd see that my presence is the problem. if i wasn't here, the weight would just lift. they could finally be happy and start over without this shadow hanging over them. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... stop being the thing that's hurting them?",
